  "description": "Ozakboy.Ai.Abstractions 的本地實作:把已安裝的 Claude Code CLI 當作子行程執行(claude --print --output-format stream-json),提示走 stdin 避開命令列長度上限,事件流逐行解析。模型在完全沒有工具的狀態下執行、不留對話紀錄、工作目錄是一個專用的空目錄,因此模型看得到的一切都由呼叫端放進提示。事件流的三個坑都處理了:判失敗以 is_error 為準(is_error 為 true 時 subtype 仍是 success)、模型名稱取自 assistant 事件且排除 <synthetic>、tool_result 的非文字區塊不會讓解析擲出。逾時以 Process.Kill(entireProcessTree: true) 終止整棵行程樹,輸出不合格時自動重問,預設不記錄提示與回應本文。除 Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 之外零相依。A local implementation of Ozakboy.Ai.Abstractions that runs the installed Claude Code CLI as a subprocess: the prompt goes through stdin, the stream-json event flow is parsed line by line, the model gets no tools and no persisted session, and the working directory is a dedicated empty one, so everything the model sees was put there by the caller. Failure is read from is_error rather than subtype, the model name comes from the assistant events with <synthetic> excluded, non-text tool_result blocks never throw, timeouts kill the whole process tree, invalid output triggers an automatic repair round, and prompts and responses stay out of the logs by default.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
