  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0 — First release. ClaudeCliClient runs the installed Claude Code CLI as a subprocess for structured output. The prompt goes through stdin. The model gets no tools and no persisted session. Timeouts kill the whole process tree. Invalid output triggers one repair round. The child process does not inherit environment variables whose names look like credentials, and callers can block their own prefixes. Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Ai.ClaudeCli/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
